  <name>QtreGBPaint</name>
  <summary>Pixel-art paint program with retro handheld-inspired palettes</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      QtreGBPaint is a small pixel-art paint program in the spirit of classic
      MS Paint, with indexed palettes inspired by classic retro handheld
      consoles.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Indexed images from 1 to 8 bits per pixel.</li>
      <li>Selection, brush, pencil, eraser, fill, line, curve, rectangle and circle tools.</li>
      <li>Undo/redo, canvas resize and bits-per-pixel changes.</li>
      <li>Indexed .idx files plus BMP and PNG export.</li>
      <li>Transparency checkerboard, grid and zoom from 1x to 64x.</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
